1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,591
Two fusions in one embryo sac: double fertilization, discovered by Nawaschin in eighteen ninety eight.

2
00:00:07,591 --> 00:00:09,270
And its point is economy.

3
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:17,890
The food store is built only after the egg has really been fertilised, so the plant never wastes food on an ovule that will not become a seed.

